     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hey All,<div><br></div><div>Come by the DSI space (directions at the bottom of this email) for our 2nd Code Review event:  <span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-size:13px\">Nistara Randhawa will be sharing some of her R code</span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-size:13px\">.  We&#39;ll meet at 11am in the DSI shared space, probably near the big TV.  From Nistara:</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-size:13px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-size:13px\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">1) the goal of my<span> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(251,246,167,0.498039);outline:transparent dashed 1px\">code</span><span> </span>is to simulate an outbreak over a network.<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">2) goals for the<span> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(251,246,167,0.498039);outline:transparent dashed 1px\">code</span><span> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(251,246,167,0.498039);outline:transparent dashed 1px\">review</span>: putting it out there for people to comment upon, suggest improvements, especially in increasing the<span> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(251,246,167,0.498039);outline:transparent dashed 1px\">code</span><span> </span>speed for a different type of outbreak/disease model.<span> </span><br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">It works fine as it is now, but I&#39;m sure there are things that could be improved (specifically for different outbreaks), or perhaps someone else could glean something valuable from my<span> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(251,246,167,0.498039);outline:transparent dashed 1px\">code</span>.<span> </span></div></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-size:13px;font-family:georgia,serif\"><span><br></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-size:13px\">Hope to see you there!</span><div><font color=\"#212121\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#212121\">Best,</font></div><div><font color=\"#212121\">Myfanwy<br></font><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,blinkmacsystemfont,&quot;segoe ui&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif,&quot;apple color emoji&quot;,&quot;segoe ui emoji&quot;,&quot;segoe ui symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">We are inside the Shields library, on the third floor (the main<span> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(251,246,167,0.498039);outline:transparent dashed 1px\">DSI</span><span> </span>classroom is 360 Shields, but the code review is in the adjacent space, in the southeast corner:</p><ul style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:2em;margin-top:0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,blinkmacsystemfont,&quot;segoe ui&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif,&quot;apple color emoji&quot;,&quot;segoe ui emoji&quot;,&quot;segoe ui symbol&quot;;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:0px\"><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Walk in the main entrance of the library and go up the first set of stairs in front of you.</li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0.25em\">Go up the second set of stairs on the right side</li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0.25em\">Go through the double doors at the top of the stairs and turn left.</li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0.25em\">Walk all the way<span> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(251,246,167,0.498039);outline:transparent dashed 1px\">to</span><span> </span>the end of the corridor.</li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0.25em\">Once at the end, walk towards the rightmost door, in the absolute corner, and ring the doorbell<span> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(251,246,167,0.498039);outline:transparent dashed 1px\">to</span>have someone let you in.</li></ul><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, segoe ui, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, apple color emoji, segoe ui emoji, segoe ui symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></font></div></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, segoe ui, helvetica, arial, sans-serif, apple color emoji, segoe ui emoji, segoe ui symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></font></div></div></div><div dir=\"ltr\">-- <br></div><div data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div>Myfanwy Johnston<div>Ph.D Candidate, UC Davis</div><div>Animal Behavior Graduate Group</div><div>Biotelemetry Laboratory</div><div><div style=\"font-size:small;font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\">__________________________</font></div><div style=\"font-size:small;font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\">I welcome VSRE emails.  </font></div><div style=\"font-size:small;font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\">Learn more at<span> </span><a href=\"http://vsre.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://vsre.info/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467005730000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1snXpWtvovk6A7lIoeMdtM\">http://vsre.info/</a> </font></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
